{"id":"fd63116e7f220f4d","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-inductive-definition-axioms.md","title":"Inductive Definition Axiom Schemes","display":"df-inductive-definition-axioms — Inductive Definition Axiom Schemes","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-inductive-definition-axioms","aliases":["18-df-inductive-definition-axioms","18-df-061"],"display":"df-inductive-definition-axioms — Inductive Definition Axiom Schemes","depends_on":["[[18-df-formula]]","[[18-df-nt]]","[[18-df-free-variable]]","[[18-df-substitution-formula]]"],"source_work":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity (Springer, 2009)","source_section":"Definition 9.1.1; axioms (ID¹₁), (ID²₁), (9.1)","source_printed_pages":"157–158","source_pdf_pages":"167–168","verification_status":"locally-revised-not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"source_proof_review":"未逐项复核原书证明","local_revision":"2026-10-14","local_review_scope":"definitions, syntax, explicit dependencies; not proof-assistant verification","prior_revision_verification_status":"source-statement-checked","prior_eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-inductive-definition-axioms"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-inductive-definition-axioms</span><span>18-df-061</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-inductive-definition-axioms — Inductive Definition Axiom Schemes"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2718a8a11c383b33\" href=\"?note=2718a8a11c383b33\" title=\"18-df-formula\">18-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0c5e56070c342728\" href=\"?note=0c5e56070c342728\" title=\"18-df-nt\">18-df-nt</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0dfe9d10a9cb0e4f\" href=\"?note=0dfe9d10a9cb0e4f\" title=\"18-df-free-variable\">18-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d6572d061e706d93\" href=\"?note=d6572d061e706d93\" title=\"18-df-substitution-formula\">18-df-substitution-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_work","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity (Springer, 2009)"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Definition 9.1.1; axioms (ID¹₁), (ID²₁), (9.1)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"157–158"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"167–168"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_review","html":"未逐项复核原书证明"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"local_review_scope","html":"definitions, syntax, explicit dependencies; not proof-assistant verification"},{"key":"prior_revision_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"prior_eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ar}}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0c5e56070c342728\" href=\"?note=0c5e56070c342728\" title=\"18-df-nt\">18-df-nt</a> 的原始递归一阶算术语言；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> 是包含它的任意一阶关系扩展语言。语法按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2718a8a11c383b33\" href=\"?note=2718a8a11c383b33\" title=\"18-df-formula\">18-df-formula</a>，替换与自由变量分别按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d6572d061e706d93\" href=\"?note=d6572d061e706d93\" title=\"18-df-substitution-formula\">18-df-substitution-formula</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0dfe9d10a9cb0e4f\" href=\"?note=0dfe9d10a9cb0e4f\" title=\"18-df-free-variable\">18-df-free-variable</a>；此处公式集合是元理论的集合，公式构造子不是对象语言中的集合运算。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 是不属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 元关系变量，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_n)\">\\(\\vec x=(x_1,\\ldots,x_n)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{X,n}\">\\(\\mathcal P_{X,n}\\)</span> 由下式定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal P_{X,n}\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal P_{X,n}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{free}(A)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{free}(A)\\subseteq\\{x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_A\">\\(P_A\\)</span> 是为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 元谓词符号，不属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\cup\\{X\\}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\cup\\{X\\}\\)</span>；它允许已经属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span>，因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\\cup\\{P_A\\}\">\\(\\mathcal L\\cup\\{P_A\\}\\)</span> 也包括不再扩张的情形。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[G/X]\">\\(A[G/X]\\)</span> 表示捕获规避的谓词替换：把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X(\\vec t)\">\\(X(\\vec t)\\)</span> 换成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G[\\vec t/\\vec x]\">\\(G[\\vec t/\\vec x]\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 可以带其他自由数变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall^*B\">\\(\\forall^*B\\)</span> 表示按固定变量顺序对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 的所有自由数变量取全称闭包。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Lit}_{\\mathrm{ar}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Lit}_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\)</span> 是算术原子公式及其否定的语法集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 遍历算术项，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 遍历数变量。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cl}_{n,A}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cl}_{n,A}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ID1Axioms}_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\mathrm{ID1Axioms}_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> 是下式引入的闭包公式构造与公理模式。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Lit}_{\\mathrm{ar}}:=\n\\mathrm{AtFml}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ar}}}\n\\cup\\{\\neg B\\mid B\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ar}}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Lit}_{\\mathrm{ar}}:=\n\\mathrm{AtFml}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ar}}}\n\\cup\\{\\neg B\\mid B\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ar}}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{X,n}:=\n\\bigcap\\left\\{\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\cup\\{X\\})\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathsf{Lit}_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\cup\\{X(\\vec t)\\mid\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ar}}}^n\\}\\subseteq\\mathcal C\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\ \\forall B,C\\in\\mathcal C\\,\n((B\\land C)\\in\\mathcal C\\land(B\\lor C)\\in\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\ \\forall B\\in\\mathcal C\\,\\forall y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ar}}}\\,\n((\\forall y\\,B)\\in\\mathcal C\\land(\\exists y\\,B)\\in\\mathcal C)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal P_{X,n}:=\n\\bigcap\\left\\{\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\cup\\{X\\})\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathsf{Lit}_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\cup\\{X(\\vec t)\\mid\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ar}}}^n\\}\\subseteq\\mathcal C\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\ \\forall B,C\\in\\mathcal C\\,\n((B\\land C)\\in\\mathcal C\\land(B\\lor C)\\in\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\ \\forall B\\in\\mathcal C\\,\\forall y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ar}}}\\,\n((\\forall y\\,B)\\in\\mathcal C\\land(\\exists y\\,B)\\in\\mathcal C)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nA[G/X]&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PSub}_{X,\\vec x,G}(A),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cl}_{n,A}(G)&amp;:=\\forall\\vec x\\,(A[G/X]\\to G),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ID1Axioms}_{\\mathcal L}(n,A,P_A)&amp;:=\n\\{\\mathrm{Cl}_{n,A}(P_A(\\vec x))\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\left\\{\n\\forall^*\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cl}_{n,A}(G)\\to\n\\forall\\vec x\\,(P_A(\\vec x)\\to G)\\bigr)\n\\ \\middle|\\ G\\in\\mathrm{Fml}(\\mathcal L\\cup\\{P_A\\})\n\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nA[G/X]&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PSub}_{X,\\vec x,G}(A),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cl}_{n,A}(G)&amp;:=\\forall\\vec x\\,(A[G/X]\\to G),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ID1Axioms}_{\\mathcal L}(n,A,P_A)&amp;:=\n\\{\\mathrm{Cl}_{n,A}(P_A(\\vec x))\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\left\\{\n\\forall^*\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cl}_{n,A}(G)\\to\n\\forall\\vec x\\,(P_A(\\vec x)\\to G)\\bigr)\n\\ \\middle|\\ G\\in\\mathrm{Fml}(\\mathcal L\\cup\\{P_A\\})\n\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应原书 (ID<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"^1_1\">\\(^1_1\\)</span>)、(ID<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"^2_1\">\\(^2_1\\)</span>) 及 (9.1)。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{X,n}\">\\(\\mathcal P_{X,n}\\)</span> 明确定义正算子公式的否定正规形语法；它不含否定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 原子。本节点保留原书的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 元算子接口，不依赖未证明的一元重编码等价。</p>\n<p>旧稿把最小性写成依赖一个未绑定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 的单个公式，且把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_A\">\\(P_A\\)</span> 错挂到 PA 定义。现在它是对扩展语言中所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 的模式，包括带数参数的实例；全称闭包绑定这些参数。算子公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 不使用新引入的归纳谓词，从而没有自我生成语言的循环。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2718a8a11c383b33","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-nt","status":"resolved","id":"0c5e56070c342728","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-nt]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"0dfe9d10a9cb0e4f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-substitution-formula","status":"resolved","id":"d6572d061e706d93","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-substitution-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-nt","status":"resolved","id":"0c5e56070c342728","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ar}}$ 是 [[18-df-nt]] 的原始递归一阶算术语言；$\\mathcal L$ 是包含它的任意一阶关系扩展语言。语法按 [[18-df-formula]]，替换与自由变量分别按 [[18-df-substitution-formula]]、[[18-df-free-variable]]；此处公式集合是元理论的集合，公式构造子不是对象语言中的集合运算。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2718a8a11c383b33","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ar}}$ 是 [[18-df-nt]] 的原始递归一阶算术语言；$\\mathcal L$ 是包含它的任意一阶关系扩展语言。语法按 [[18-df-formula]]，替换与自由变量分别按 [[18-df-substitution-formula]]、[[18-df-fre